Traeger– From the moment the Treger patent expired, a lot of manufacturers appeared on the market, willing to compete for every client. That way a lot of much cheaper and better models were made which resulted in an opinion that by buying a Traeger product you’re overpaying for the brand only.
Traeger– As recently as 2018 I would say that there is no difference when it comes to the basic features and equipment compared to Pit Boss. It all changed with introduction of the new refurbished series from Traeger, which includes plenty of useful features up to date with modern technology.
