Bluetooth full stack solution to meet the growing market demand
Bluetooth revolutionized the audio world and revolutionized the way people use media and experience the world by eliminating the need for cables for headsets, speakers and other devices. Main use cases include: wireless earphones, wireless speakers, in-car systems, etc.
As the demand for greater flexibility and mobility increases, the use of Bluetooth technology in wireless headphones and speakers will continue to expand. In 2022, 675 million Bluetooth headsets and 374 million Bluetooth speakers are expected to be shipped.
In addition, building on two decades of innovation, LE Audio will enhance the performance of Bluetooth Audio by delivering higher Audio quality at lower power consumption, driving the continued growth of the entire Audio peripherals market (headsets, in-ear headphones, etc. ).
35% of the connected devices of the Internet of Things will adopt Bluetooth technology. The demand for Bluetooth PC accessories continues to rise as more and more people’s home Spaces become both personal and work Spaces, increasing the demand for Bluetooth connected homes and peripherals.
