Robert ‘Bob’ Flowe serves as Chief Financial Officer of Beacon Health Options, Inc. During his 33 year tenure with Beacon, Bob has served in several senior and executive leadership roles. He brings a deep knowledge of Beacon’s business and expertise.
Our mission and values guide the way we treat our providers, members and each other. They are at the heart of all we do.
CENTERED AROUND YOU AND YOUR PATIENTS
Beacon provides clinical staff coverage 24 hours/day, 7 days/week, 365 days/year to respond to all member and provider calls, including emergent, urgent and routine calls.
Distribute and review a written copy Member Rights and Responsibilities at the initiation of every new treatment episode and include in the Member’s medical record documentation of this review.
