The mission of Beacon Care Services, a Beacon Health Options company, is to help people live their lives to the fullest potential. We operate in community retail settings for improved access to convenient, affordable behavioral health services.
Beacon Care Services has licensed clinical social workers and trained counselors in convenient and accessible locations, such as retail stores. Individuals with common behavioral health issues, such as depression, anxiety, grief, troubled relationships and more, can get the help they need when and where they need it.
We recognize the importance of “whole person/whole health” and work with different types of providers who can treat all aspects of a person’s wellbeing. We assess health and life factors to identify and address both the obvious and less obvious issues.
We work with the individual to develop a treatment plan that includes personalized goals and objectives to reach recovery. The plan’s strategies consider an individual’s way of life to help that person better meet his/her goals.
By improving access to care, people can address their behavioral health and wellness concerns before they turn into bigger, more serious problems. The comprehensive and personalized treatment plans result in care that works, which in turn leads to happier, more meaningful lives.
