Any balance operation (i.e. deposits and withdrawals) on the Sub-Account leads to the automatic recalculation of the shares of all members of the master MAM account.
The Investors and the Account Manager agree that the Company shall not be required to pay any funds, including the Account Manager’s incentive fee if there are not sufficient funds in the Investor’s Sub-Account.
